  description: '1 Tuner + 1+ Synchro Monsters

    The Levels of monsters your opponent
    controls are increased by 2. Your Tuners can make a second attack during each
    Battle Phase. When your opponent activates a monster effect (Quick Effect): You
    can target 1 Tuner in your GY or banishment, except a Level 10 Tuner; add it
    to your hand or Special Summon it, then immediately after this effect resolves,
    you can Synchro Summon 1 Synchro Monster. You can only use this effect of "Kewl
    Tune B2B" twice per turn.'
